Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 23:49:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Add family-scoped migration control plane without
 promoting opening counts.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Reuse M1–M5 contracts for transitive gold isolation, provider envelopes,
authority routing, claim arbitration, source/measurement binders, an
append-only decision ledger, family rollback, and a standard migration
report. The frozen opening-count provider stays NEW_SHADOW behind a thin
adapter; extraction, gold, mappings, and the 24/61 legacy headline are
unchanged.
